WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.239
One fine day Skunk was playing with his friends.

2
00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:16.787
"Ha! This is a lot of fun!" he said. Then he lifted his tail. "Oops!"

3
00:00:16.788 --> 00:00:25.323
"Ew! What a terrible smell! Skunk made a bad smell. Ha-ha!" said Mouse.

4
00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:33.283
"Yes, ew!" said Rabbit. "Let's go play with someone else. Skunk stinks."

5
00:00:33.284 --> 00:00:38.443
The next day Skunk saw Rabbit and Mouse. Skunk lowered his tail.

6
00:00:38.444 --> 00:00:41.421
He did not want to make a bad smell again.

7
00:00:41.422 --> 00:00:46.592
"Hi, Rabbit! Don't you want to play with me?" said Skunk.

8
00:00:46.593 --> 00:00:50.417
"No! Stinky Skunk!" said Rabbit.

9
00:00:50.418 --> 00:00:55.725
"Let's not play with him. He smells bad," said Mouse.

10
00:00:55.726 --> 00:01:08.598
Skunk cried and ran to his cave. "No one wants to play with me."

11
00:01:08.599 --> 00:01:13.329
He did not come out until nighttime. He was very sad.

12
00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:18.521
One day Skunk was very thirsty. He left the cave and went to the pond.

13
00:01:18.522 --> 00:01:22.262
He still held his tail very low.

14
00:01:22.263 --> 00:01:30.286
"Oh, there is Rabbit," he said. "I must be careful not to make a bad smell."

15
00:01:30.287 --> 00:01:33.192
Rabbit ran past the pond.

16
00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:39.104
"Rabbit, please stop for a moment and play with me," said Skunk.

17
00:01:39.105 --> 00:01:43.321
"I will try not to make a bad smell again."

18
00:01:43.322 --> 00:01:47.456
But Rabbit kept running. Skunk felt very sad.

19
00:01:47.457 --> 00:01:53.075
He had no friends and no one to play with.

20
00:01:53.076 --> 00:01:57.520
He knew he smelled bad, but there was nothing he could do about it.

21
00:01:57.521 --> 00:02:01.823
Several lonely days passed, and Skunk went for a walk.

22
00:02:01.824 --> 00:02:05.747
All of a sudden, Skunk saw that Rabbit was in trouble.

23
00:02:05.748 --> 00:02:10.796
"Oh no! Bear is chasing Rabbit!" said Skunk.

24
00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:22.621
"What can I do? Bear is so big and has such big teeth. He might eat me too!"

25
00:02:22.622 --> 00:02:31.191
Skunk decided to run away. Just as Skunk turned around to run, Rabbit saw him.

26
00:02:31.192 --> 00:02:35.400
"Skunk, help me! Please!" she cried.

27
00:02:35.401 --> 00:02:39.118
"Oh, poor Rabbit!" thought Skunk.

28
00:02:39.119 --> 00:02:48.638
"What should I do? Oh! Maybe my bad smell will chase him away."

29
00:02:48.639 --> 00:02:58.177
Skunk went up to Bear. "Let Rabbit go, or I will make a bad smell!" he said.

30
00:02:58.178 --> 00:03:04.153
"Ha-ha!" Bear laughed. "A smell? You are so funny, little Skunk.

31
00:03:04.154 --> 00:03:06.923
Let me smell your bad smell."

32
00:03:06.924 --> 00:03:09.622
So Skunk lifted his tail.

33
00:03:09.623 --> 00:03:15.265
"Nooo! Ahhh! Ugh! Ew!" cried Bear, and he ran away.

34
00:03:15.266 --> 00:03:26.401
Rabbit was so happy! She hugged Skunk! "Skunk, your smell saved my life.

35
00:03:26.402 --> 00:03:31.863
Hey, everyone! Hooray for Skunk! He saved me from Bear."

36
00:03:31.864 --> 00:03:36.102
"Hooray for Skunk!" the animals cheered.

37
00:03:36.103 --> 00:03:40.886
Skunk became a hero! All the animals surrounded Skunk.

38
00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:45.254
"Show us how you scared Bear away," Mouse asked.

39
00:03:45.255 --> 00:03:51.255
"Okay," said Skunk. "I lifted my tail like this . . ."

40
00:03:51.256 --> 00:03:56.722
All the animals held their noses. And then they all laughed.

41
00:03:56.723 --> 00:03:59.991
"Let's go play together," said Rabbit.

42
00:03:59.992 --> 00:04:04.303
"Yes, let's go play!" said Skunk.

43
00:04:04.304 --> 00:04:09.920
On that day, Skunk realized he was perfect just the way he was.
